{
  "id": "ACT.16",
  "number": "16",
  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Tlehhma'Aá Ya/Abuuse 16",
  "verseCount": 40,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo iri hardáh dír gixsár Derbe nee Listra, nee didaádane eeharusmoó wák i deer, umuuwós ku bay Timoteo. Inós a garmoó /ameenirkar Yahudi ar Mungú gwa haratlinti'. Ala baabuúwós a heé Yunani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heewí kwa lamabu'úngw hhó' i káh nee mukdaá haratlintii' oo baraá Listra nee Ikonio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo Timoteo guna slaá' tiwa alkona'. Gurir tláy, guri al/uútl, as múk Yahudi oo amoodí dirií', asma sleémeero ka xuu' adór baabuúwós tar heé Yunani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín gixsadu kina alhi'iimiít, hhae kiri ádbabáy adoodá' kira hara'ayín nee ya/abuuse nee bariise, tidá' Yerusalemúr i dirii' ngiwa harmagaahhiya'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe kríshaanáy umuúqo diiro /uuru guri sláy baraá haratlintaaoodae, faaror'ín iri doogigiín umuúqo baalaaro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari waaraáhh ar baraá yaamaá Frigia nee Galatia. Qeeruú hhoohhoó' oo Mungú gaa aleeya/aniká axweesantá Mungú kawa alki/iiti baraá yaamaá Asiaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár yaamaá Misia kiwa i qón, daqeemuú Bitinia kuri iiár, ala Qeeruú Yesu aa ya/aniká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari waaraáhh ar yaamaá Misia, tari aweér ay Troa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo xweeraawo iigu'utu guri ár. Heé yaamaá Makedonia guna ár, i sihhimiit, i Paúló babay, «Waaraahháng amór yaamaá Makedonia, atén ti alee/isár eer.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo iigu'utudá' arto nguwa hhe'eés, hamtidár kilae tleemuú Makedonia kuri sla'aán, asma aga tsaahhaán ar ló' Mungú atén taa ateét, as Ya/abtór hho' kawa dir'íní alki/ituú awaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari tlawaán ar miringamo Troár wa ale, tari waarahhaán ay Samotrake, ala aga sihhiitaniiká. Nee bál tsár tari hardahaán ay Neapoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee niwa didá' wa tlawaán, tari hardahaán ay gixsár Makedonia ar ta bay Filipi, an gixsár ur baraá ayaadae, slám an dír boómár múk Roma i diri'. Tari hootaán baraá gixsadá' wa ale deelór hhaawaakahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bál deelór Sabaátoro ana tlawaán nay ti'iitaán tsee/áy alé afkú gixsaro, tari tlawaán afaá yaae. Asma atén ka xuaan dír tawa firarin i deer. Tari iwiitaán tari axweesaán nee /ameenarka aa didií burumburit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Ameenirka ta bay Lidia didae i deer. Inós inqwaruú sirda/atén gun weermaamís. Inós ar baraá yaamaá Tiatira. Inós i Munguú ilaiwaawá/. Atén tiri iiárií qás, nee Aako muunaáwós guri gweér, axweesantadá' Paulo aa axweés gari ót. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós baatisaro kawa hhe'eés nee múk do'ose, tiri harhheehhe'és iri ó', «Kuungá' bar aga aandé' aníng Aako ugwa haratlintií', qwalaasé', hooté' baraá dooeé' wa ale.» Tiri harakés.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Looarka wake tawa didár saalíngw kawaan, nee lawaalo'orka tina doogaán ar neetlaamér aaru'uumár koom. Inós daqaareerós gan daqaari'iimár yaariírí slaasleér ar loohír aaru'uuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo guri eehát, nee atene, i aluurén wa tseeamiín i kat, «Mukwí a sagadiyuusér Munguú Gáwtí dirií'. Inooín kángw loohír ba/ama kun alki/iit.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorí gari tlehhít deelór yaariire. Ala Paulo iri gurhaamuút, iri alií warqáy, neetlangwdá' guri báy, «Aníng kuúng u báw ar umuú Yesu Kristo, ti'iít baraá lawaalo'oorihe.» Neetlangwdá' iri ti'iít siiwadár kilae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala daqaareerós adór haraxu'utír daqaari'iimar'ín ira qwát ngiwa aán, Paulo nee Sila kiri uhín, kiri duuruxún ay dír boo/oó muu baraá gixsa, dír doó kwasleema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiri huúw ay dír geeraá bariisér uren ar kwasleema, tari oó', «Mukwí i tlaahhír qamín ló'wa aleeró baraá gixsarén tihe. Slám inooín a múk Yahudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín uunuú atén wa hariima'aaká ilaooharo tam eeharto ngin intsaahhatimisiyá', asma atén a múk Roma.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boo/aay sleémeero iri bartá wák áy, Paulo nee Sila kiri inqwar duxún nee bariisér kwasleema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee bariiseedár kwasleema hara'aya gari ó', kiwa muxi ar hhara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee kiwa hhe'eés muxtár yaariire, kiri kwaáhh baraá doó tseegamo. Xuumusmooduú doó tseegamór ga/áw kuri báy, «Mukwí ló'wa xuumeek.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós tí kwaa báy ngiwa axaás, giri kwahha hhe'eés baraá qul/ír baraá do', giri ya'a' tsegiít ar peehhoó iló'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Paulo nee Sila qoomár amsiwo Mungú kuri firín, nee nguri i daaiyé' ar daa'ángw ilahhooa. Nee mukduú hatlá' taa tseegiít ta axamiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamtidár kilae kunseelír ur niri hardát, tam koo/ír do'duú tseegamo iri dingít. Nee afér do' iri adaá gweerít, nee qutúruudá' muu sleémeero kura tsegiít iri slakwekwe'eét. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xuumusmooduú doó tseegamo iri daarkiít, adór afér doó tseegamo ira gweerít ngiwa ár, paánga gari taataáhh, ti gaasár wa slaa'. Asma inós ngi xui mukdá' taa tsegiít aa /akumiít. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Paulo iri tseé' ar afór ur, iri oó', «Miti gaasaar, asma atén sleémeero a diirí diriiaán.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xuumusmoodá' tsaa'asi gari firín kawa huwi. Iri dáh ay baraá do', i hara daaraax as dae. Iri tumbarara'aát dír Paulo nee Sila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo nee Sila ngirirar ti'iít tsee/áy alé, iri oó', «Bariíse, aníng adór ni laaq a adoomá ar nir ba/am?»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuri báy, «Aako Yesu na haratlintieek. Daqaní kuúng a ba/aán nee múk do'oge.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Axweesantá Aako kari dirós i alki/iít, inós nee múk do'ós sleémeerowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xuumusmoodá' Paulo nee Sila giri ar tláy siiwadár kilár xweeraawo, inkahhi'ii'ín giri hamaátl. Inós nee múk do'ós sleémeero kiri baatiís siiwadár kilae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xuumusmoodá' Paulo nee Sila giri ar waátl amór do'ós i alé, giri muruú /aymár i tleéhh. Inós nee múk do'ós sleémeero tari qwalalaá/, asma Mungú kwaa haratlintií'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár looa niwa tleér, bariiseedár kwasleema mukdá' urén oo askaári kuri ya/aáw, tari oó', «Mukdá' geemawaak, i tlay amor'ín ar ta slai.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xuumusmooduú doó tseegamo axweesantadá' gari dír Paulo i oó', «Bariiseedár kwasleema muu ngwa ya/áp kuungá' tunduwa gweeri. Ala daxta ti'iité' tsee/a, tlawsé' ar wayda.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo giri báy, «Atén tina muúx dír geeraá múk wa aleeró, ala atén taa sakwasleemuutiiká. Nee atén a múk Roma. Slám atén tina kwahhiyé' baraá doó tseegamo. Nee hám qaytsiít, ti qawtí duuxár wa slaiyá'. Adoorí i ya/aandaaká. Inooíná kilá' ni hardihiye', atén ti duuxár aye'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Askaáridá' kaangwí guri húp amór bariiseedár kwasleema. Nee bariiseedár kwasleema adoorí ngiwa axás, adór inooín tar múk Roma, tari ló'wa da'ayuút. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bariiseedár kwasleema niri hardát, Paulo nee Sila kiri harhheehhe'eemiís. Nee kiwa hhe'eés tsee/áy duuxaro, kiri harhheehhe'eés tawa ti'iiti baraá gixsarihe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo nee Sila tindiwa ti'iít baraá doó tseegamooro, tari dáh baraá doó Lidia. Tiri doogiyé' nee hhae. Hhae kiri gurkwa/amís. Paulo nee Sila tari tláy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
